stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> new
    new --> triaged: analyst reviews alert
    triaged --> investigating: analyst opens investigation
    investigating --> contained: response action executed
    investigating --> false_positive: analyst marks false positive
    contained --> resolved: root cause addressed
    false_positive --> [*]
    resolved --> [*]

    note right of new
        Incident created by correlation
        engine from 1+ related alerts
    end note

    note right of investigating
        AI summary generated,
        investigation checklist followed,
        analyst notes added
    end note
